(
// dark_svartsengi — the cooking, server-free (web rule A4; CONTRACT §5 "sound-side cooking").
//
// Data quantity → synth parameter happens HERE and nowhere else. The page sends the data already normalised
// (abs = whole-sequence ranges, room = percentile on screen, level weights, speed: the page is the clock, R4);
